UPDATE companies SET description='Northern Furniture Manufacturing LLC was established in 2021 in Grantsburg, Wisconsin, when Fresh Industries—a global home-furnishings sourcing company founded in 2009—acquired the former Northern Manufacturing Co. from the Norenberg family. The business operates as a family-owned venture dedicated to domestic upholstered furniture production, reviving an industry that had existed in the town since the 1950s.

The company designs and builds modern upholstered furniture—including sofas, chairs, ottomans, and beds—for major retailers. Production is made-to-order and scaled for global distribution, with all manufacturing taking place at its Grantsburg facility. Northern Furniture emphasizes hiring and training local talent, though specific facility size, headcount, and annual volume are not disclosed.

Its customers are lifestyle-focused brands and major retailers that sell through stores and online channels.

Northern Furniture was started to bring furniture manufacturing back to northwest Wisconsin and to invest in the local community. The company cites its parent company’s 15-plus years of furniture and textile experience, a commitment to open communication and problem-solving, and a focus on quality, comfort, and design as what sets it apart.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Upholstered furniture manufacturing", "Furniture design", "Made-to-order production", "Global scale manufacturing", "Local workforce training"], "industries": ["Home furnishings", "Retail", "Lifestyle brands"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made-to-order furniture production on a global scale", "Family-owned operation with parent company Fresh Industries (15+ years industry experience)", "Committed to hiring and training local talent in Grantsburg, Wisconsin", "Dedicated to service with open communication, honesty, and problem-solving", "Community-focused, giving back to local charities and businesses"], "facts_used": ["Location: Grantsburg, Wisconsin -> /", "Founded 2021 by Fresh Industries acquiring Northern Manufacturing Co. -> /", "Family-owned business -> /", "Designs and builds upholstered furniture (sofas, chairs, ottomans, beds) -> /", "Made-to-order production for major retailers on global scale -> /", "Serves lifestyle-focused brands and major retailers -> /", "Parent company Fresh Industries founded 2009, 15+ years experience -> /", "Committed to hiring local talent and community investment -> /", "No direct-to-consumer sales -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We design and build modern, upholstered furniture such as sofas, chairs, ottomans and beds for major retailers.", "founded_year": "2021", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='northern-furniture-manufacturing-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Northern Hydraulics Inc. has operated from Black Eagle, Montana, on the northern edge of Great Falls, since 1963. Founded as a hydraulic supply house, the company serves the region’s farms, fleets, and industrial operations with a focus on hydraulic components and equipment.

The company stocks over 15,700 hydraulic parts from more than 60 manufacturers, including Stanley, Enerpac, Bucher/Monarch, Parker, Williams, Char-Lynn, and others. Its catalog covers pumps, cylinders, motors, valves, power units, fittings, quick couplers, and log-splitter components. Beyond distribution, Northern Hydraulics offers custom build orders, repair services, and a dedicated sourcing desk that tracks down obsolete or hard-to-find parts, typically responding the same day. Orders for stocked items ship the same day, and qualifying orders receive free shipping.

Customers range from agricultural producers and fleet maintenance shops to industrial facilities across the United States. The company’s walk-in counter in Black Eagle serves local buyers, while its online catalog and phone support handle nationwide orders. Business accounts can use purchase-order checkout, apply for credit terms, and submit parts lists for consolidated quotes with volume discounts and cross-references for discontinued items.

