UPDATE companies SET description='Odyssey Electronics operates from Livonia, Michigan. The company has provided printed circuit board assembly services for more than 35 years, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The company runs two production facilities totaling more than 32,000 square feet, equipped with five surface-mount technology lines. Its in-house capabilities span surface mount assembly, thru-hole assembly, wave and selective soldering, automated optical inspection, X-ray verification, in-circuit testing, boundary scan, functional testing, conformal coating, potting, and turn-key assembly. Odyssey handles projects ranging from low-volume prototype runs of ten boards to high-volume manufacturing of ten thousand units or more.

Odyssey serves a broad set of industries including military electronics, medical, alternative energy, audio and video, industrial and commercial, telematics and telecommunications, life science, and LED lighting. Customers range from engineers developing early prototypes to global brands requiring full-scale production across multiple continents.

The company emphasizes a single-roof model that reduces handoffs and centralizes quality control. Its facilities are ISO 9001:2015 certified and meet IPC-A-610 standards, with 100 percent inspection including automated optical inspection and X-ray at multiple production stages. Odyssey is also ITAR registered, supporting defense programs with documented traceability and compliance.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount Technology (SMT)", "Thru-hole Assembly", "Wave Soldering", "Selective Soldering", "Automated Optical Inspection (AOI)", "X-ray Inspection", "In-Circuit Testing (ICT)", "Boundary Scan Testing", "Functional Testing", "Conformal Coating", "Potting", "Turn-key Assembly", "Component Sourcing", "Design Support"], "industries": ["Military Electronics", "Medical", "Alternative Energy", "Audio & Video", "Industrial & Commercial", "Telematics & Telecommunications", "Life Science", "LED Lighting"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Five SMT lines", "Automated optical inspection", "X-ray verification", "In-circuit testing", "Boundary scan", "Functional testing"], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Two facilities totaling 32,000 sq ft with five SMT lines", "All processes in-house: SMT, thru-hole, coating, potting, testing, turn-key", "ISO 9001:2015 certified, IPC-A-610 standards, 100% inspection including AOI and X-ray", "ITAR registered for defense work"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Livonia, Michigan -> db", "Certifications: ISO9001, ISO13485, ITAR -> db", "Industries served: Military Electronics, Medical, Alternative Energy, Audio & Video, Industrial & Commercial, Telematics & Telecommunications, Life Science, LED Lighting -> db", "LinkedIn URL -> db", "Facilities: two production facilities totaling more than 32,000 square feet -> /", "Five SMT lines -> /", "Capabilities: SMT, thru-hole, wave/selective solder, AOI, X-ray, ICT, b