UPDATE companies SET description='Off Road Warehouse operates a retail and service location at 6545 S. Decatur Boulevard in Las Vegas, Nevada. The store functions as part of the 4 Wheel Parts network, which operates over 40 performance centers nationwide. No founding year or ownership details are publicly disclosed for this specific outlet.

