UPDATE companies SET description='OnChip Devices, Inc. is headquartered in Santa Clara, California. The company operates an advanced silicon fabrication facility and maintains partnerships with full turn-key assembly houses in Asia.

The company manufactures Integrated Passive Devices (IPDs) that combine resistors, capacitors, and diodes on a monolithic silicon substrate, as well as Thin Film and CMOS components. Inspection covers defects such as embedded foreign material, metallization voids, contamination, surface scratches, and dicing defects. Services are offered at wafer level or after dicing in waffle packs or gelpaks.

OnChip serves the high-brightness LED, computing, and consumer electronics markets. Its devices are used in handsets, notebook PCs, MP3 players, and printers. The inspection services meet commercial, military, and medical electronics specifications.

