UPDATE companies SET description='Origin Factory Store, operating under the ORIGIN® brand, is headquartered in Farmington, Maine. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed in the available sources. The business presents itself as an American-made apparel, footwear, and gear brand with a focus on domestic manufacturing.

ORIGIN produces a range of soft goods and footwear including performance denim, stretch canvas work pants, sneakers, fleece hoodies, performance polos, waffle-knit layers, and training apparel. Key product lines feature proprietary fabrics such as MOAB™ stretch canvas, NanoRip stretch-woven ripstop, and CORE Waffle knit (69% polyester/31% cotton). The company states that its joggers are manufactured in North Carolina and that its sneakers are assembled from a 100% U.S. supply chain—including Vibram® outsoles and MOAB™ uppers—by skilled American craftsmen. Manufacturing processes encompass cut-and-sew assembly, knitwear production, ripstop weaving, felled-seam construction, gusseted patterning, double-needle topstitching, and military-spec hardware installation.

The brand serves consumer markets directly through its e-commerce channel, targeting outdoor, tactical, training, and Brazilian jiu-jitsu (BJJ) enthusiasts. No business-to-business customers or industrial end markets are identified in the source material.

ORIGIN positions its domestic supply chain as a differentiator, framing the re-establishment of American sneaker and apparel manufacturing as a new standard for quality and durability. The company emphasizes overbuilt construction, odor-control technologies such as HeiQ Fresh, and durable water-repellent finishes to extend product life across work, training, and daily wear.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Apparel cut-and-sew assembly", "Footwear assembly", "Denim construction (3x-felled inseam)", "Fleece manufacturing (ring-spun terry, heavyweight cotton)", "Knitwear production (waffle knit, performance polo)", "Ripstop fabric fabrication (NanoRip stretch-woven)", "Odor-control treatment application (HeiQ Fresh)", "Durable water-repellent (DWR) finishing", "Gusseted construction for mobility", "Double-needle topstitching", "Military-spec coil zipper installation", "Body-mapped patterning with reverse yokes"], "industries": ["Consumer apparel", "Footwear", "Tactical and outdoor gear", "Martial arts (BJJ) gear"], "materials": ["Vibram\u00ae rubber", "MOAB\u2122 proprietary upper material", "69% polyester / 31% cotton blend (CORE Waffle)", "HeiQ Fresh odor-control treatment", "NanoRip stretch-woven fabric", "DWR (durable water-repellent) finish", "Ring-spun terry fleece", "Heavyweight cotton fleece"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% American supply chain from raw material to final assembly", "Proprietary fabric platforms: MOAB\u2122 canvas, NanoRip ripstop, CORE Waffle knit", "Footwear assembled in the U.S. using Vibram\u00ae outsoles and domestic uppers", "HeiQ Fresh odor-control treatment without heavy metals or antimicrobials", "Durable water-repellent (DWR) finish on training bottoms"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Origin Factory Store -> db", "Brand: ORIGIN\u00ae -> /", "Headquarters: Farmington, Maine -> db", "Website: originusa.com -> db", "Product categories: apparel, boots, BJJ