UPDATE companies SET description='Ozark Solar is based in Bella Vista, Arkansas. Founded in 2007 by Josh Whittle, who serves as owner, the company began with a focus on bringing energy independence to a four-state region covering Arkansas, Oklahoma, Missouri, and Kansas.

The firm provides solar installation and roofing services. Its offerings include grid-tied solar systems, hybrid off-grid/grid-tied systems, commercial solar installations, residential roofing repair and replacement, off-grid solar systems using Fortress Power equipment, whole-home Generac generator installations, and solar panel detachment and reset services. The company reports that its installations have generated over 1.7 gigawatts of solar energy to date.

Ozark Solar serves residential and commercial customers across its service area. Residential clients include homeowners seeking grid-tied or off-grid power, as well as remote cabins, farms, and homesteads. Commercial clients range from small businesses to larger facilities requiring roofing and solar solutions.

The company emphasizes integrity and transparency, stating it is fully bonded and offers financing options with $0 down for qualified applicants. It also assists customers in claiming the 30% federal investment tax credit. A noted operational differentiator is a 7- to 14-day turnaround for solar panel detachment and reset work.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Grid-tied solar system installation", "Hybrid off-grid/grid-tied system installation", "Commercial solar installation", "Residential roofing repair and replacement", "Off-grid solar system installation (Fortress Power)", "Whole-home Generac generator installation", "Solar panel detachment and reset"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Fortress Power systems", "Generac generators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "7-14 days for solar panel detachment and reset", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fully bonded", "Transparent pricing and cost structure", "Financing options including $0 down for qualified applicants", "Assistance with 30% federal ITC solar tax credit", "7-14 day turnaround for solar panel detachment and reset"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2007 -> db", "Headquarters in Bella Vista, Arkansas -> db", "Owner Josh Whittle -> /", "Company established in 2007, serving Arkansas, Oklahoma, Missouri, Kansas -> /", "Installations produced over 1.7 GW of solar energy -> /", "Services: grid-tied, hybrid, commercial solar, residential roofing, off-grid (Fortress Power), Generac generators, solar detach & reset -> /", "Serves residential and commercial customers -> /", "Off-grid systems for remote cabins, farms, homesteads -> /", "Fully bonded -> /", "Transparent pricing and best value -> /", "Financing options with $0 down for qualified applicants -> /", "Assistance with 30% ITC solar tax credit -> /", "Solar panel detachment and reset in 7-14 days -> /", "Uses Fortress Power systems -> /", "Installs Generac generators -> /"], "company_type": "Ins